          "text": "Description: On September 27, 1998, at 3:00 AM, a witness observed in the sky a round, bright object with a yellowish color. The object was at the side of a hill and moved very slowly. After about five minutes, the object suddenly accelerated and disappeared before any explanation could be given for the phenomenon.",
